<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Micron Electronics EPS.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Micron Electronics EPS.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Rodman &amp; Renshaw said it raised its earnings estimates on Micron Electronics Inc for the next two fiscal years, following Micron's release of fiscal first quarter earnings of $0.27 per share, well above Rodman's $0.18 estimate.</p>
<p>-- Raised FY 1997 estimate to $1.22 per share from $0.96.</p>
<p>-- Raised FY 1998 estimate to $1.72 per share from $1.60.</p>
<p>-- Set 12-month target price at $27 per share, based on 20 times calendar 1997 estimate of $1.34 per share.</p>
<p>-- Reiterated buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 7/8 to 19-1/2.</p>
</text>
